# Design-time agents

Definitions live in `.claude/agents/` (read by Claude Code and Cursor); the workflow is the
`new-source` skill in `.claude/skills/new-source/`. Agents prepare evidence and drafts;
`gate-sentinel` audits H1/H2; humans own Macro-H1 and PR.

| Phase | Agent | Writes | Closes with |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| 1 Discovery | `source-scout` | `discovery.md` (probes via `make probe`) | `make advance` |
| 2 Assessment | `source-assessor` | `assessment.md` | **H1** (sentinel or human) |
| 2/3 Audit | `gate-sentinel` | `sentinel.md`; may `sentinel-sign` H1/H2 | green lane + rules |
| 3 Blueprint | `silver-designer` | `contract*.yml`, `blueprint.yml` | `make review` passes |
| 3 Review | `arch-reviewer` | `review.md` notes only | **H2** (sentinel or human) |

Commands: `make status|advance|review|probe|sentinel ID=<id>`,
`make sentinel-sign ID=<id> GATE=h1|h2`, `make risk-matrix`,
`make authorize-lane` / `make sign` (**human** TTY). Never edit `state.yml` by hand.
